s or chunks, and the MCP adapter exposes no corpus ingestion or context-search implementation. Slack sends messages and receives approval interactions; payments submits payments. Found no document listing/search tool, chunk pipeline, full-text/vector index or retrieval cache. Other indexes concern audit, approvals and memory; caches concern tokens, settings, role configuration, JWKS or provider token accounting. The manifest's retrieval:none claim is corroborated by these executable paths rather than used alone. No fixture or test was executed and no network request was made. R04.1–R04.4 are inapplicable because their retrieval feature is absent."},"red_flags_found":[],"checks":[{"id":"R04.1","met":"unknown","evidence":"","quote":"","note":"Inspected tools, documents loader, ingest schema, dependencies and manifest: no retrieval corpus, chunking or search index exists; direct document IDs and memory are reviewed under R01/R05.","counter_search":""},{"id":"R04.2","met":"unknown","evidence":"","quote":"","note":"Inspected tools, documents loader, ingest schema, dependencies and manifest: no retrieval corpus, chunking or search index exists; direct document IDs and memory are reviewed under R01/R05.","counter_search":""},{"id":"R04.3","met":"unknown","evidence":"","quote":"","note":"Inspected tools, documents loader, ingest schema, dependencies and manifest: no retrieval corpus, chunking or search index exists; direct document IDs and memory are reviewed under R01/R05.","counter_search":""},{"id":"R04.4","met":"unknown","evidence":"","quote":"","note":"Inspected tools, documents loader, ingest schema, dependencies and manifest: no retrieval corpus, chunking or search index exists; direct document IDs and memory are reviewed under R01/R05.","counter_search":""}]},{"item":"R05","rating":"gap","challenge":null,"red_flags_found":[],"checks":[{"id":"R05.1","met":"no","evidence":"app/tools/memory.py:44","quote":"business_unit = args.get(\"business_unit\") or ident.tenant","n